1
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:03,780
Do you get complaints from inside?

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,780
Yes, children also complain.

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,840
Like they drop dustbin or something like that.

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,360
Sometimes these dogs are barking outside the street.

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,260
They bite people.

6
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,120
What else? This is the only problem.

7
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,680
You people only complain about this thing.

8
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,560
Children do it too.

9
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:25,340
So what do you say when a complaint comes,

10
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,920
then how do you get action?

11
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:29,780
They ask us to take them out.

12
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:34,280
So, is there any action taken?

13
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,440
Yes. I have not done anything to kill them.

14
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:40,620
I have told them that they should not go out and play in the street.

15
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:41,240
They shouldn't be killed.

16
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,820
That means they should stay outside but not come inside.

17
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:50,340
And what do you think if you also face problems then they should stay outside the hostel or...

18
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:55,440
We don't have any problem because the professionals or children are always in this issue

19
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:57,760
that dogs bite. Dogs also bite their kids.

20
00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:12,340
So, you have to get up and go again and again.

21
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:12,840
What happened?

22
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:14,300
You have to get up and go again and again.

23
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,400
What do you think we should do then?

24
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:19,320
Dogs are coming in front of the house.

25
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:22,220
They are coming, you see what can people do there.

26
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:25,260
I have done this for them not to beat dogs.

27
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:28,080
They have put a tent on the road and they have been thrown out.

28
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,140
That's all we can do.

29
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:31,900
You say that if they come inside, what will you do?

30
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:34,740
We will throw them out again and again.

31
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,360
Have you ever seen someone being bitten by a dog?

32
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,540
Yes, my son has bitten our lady guard.

33
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:51,660
I have cut the dog in front of the library.

34
00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:56,280
As soon as they go on scooty, they run after them.

35
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:57,400
They run after them and catch their feet.

36
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:59,260
They fall from there too.

37
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,380
I haven't seen this yet.

38
00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:03,540
But yes, dogs run after them.

39
00:02:04,660 --> 00:02:06,660
And people feed them also.

40
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:09,560
They don't feed here because it is a point.

41
00:02:10,740 --> 00:02:12,040
They feed at that point only.

42
00:02:12,540 --> 00:02:14,560
I haven't seen this before.

43
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,520
You didn't see this place?

44
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:17,400
Because earlier one girl used to feed them.

45
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,980
Thank you for watching.

